COUNT FINDING: BELOW THE HARD GATE on BTCUSD, ETHUSDT, SOLUSDT

Per the intake, LOOKBACK and SKIP are NOT changed and no grid
is run. A symbol below the gate cannot support a POSITIVE claim
for this family, and a window moved to reach a count would be a
parameter fitted to an observed shortfall.
